        },
        "testimonial_A9AeQw": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>This supplement came highly recommended to me and I tolerate it well. Each time I open the jar I smell the fresh, lovely fragrance of ginger, turmeric and other components.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Deborah Stockton"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_JUk3jw": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>It works like Tribe says !! No fillers like other brands. Did my research…have been taking Turmeric Complex for a year now along with Bosweilla Complex. Another great product. I’m 77 yrs old & feel great!! Don’t cheat yourself!! Try it!!!<br/><br/></p>",
            "author_name": "- Peggy Minner"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_88qjkH": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>My body has reacted amazing to the products. I used to have some on/off knee pain, since taking the product, I no longer have it! I just purchased some more to share with family members! Highly recommend!<br/><br/></p>",
            "author_name": "- Jenny Mendino"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_RWCiqA": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>So far so good period came on time, packaged well and easy to take. This is the third day that I’ve taken them and I feel pretty good</p>",
            "author_name": "- Leanne"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_wFnmxx": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
