        "section_title": "<h2>MEET TURMERIC COMPLEX: The Golden Herb for Modern Living.</h2>",
        "section_subtitle": "<p>For over 5,000 years, Turmeric (Curcuma longa) has been revered in Ayurvedic medicine as a powerful herb for restoring balance, easing inflammation and promoting longevity. Known in India as “The Golden Spice,” Turmeric was used to soothe joints, support digestion and strengthen resilience against daily stress.<br><br>\n\nToday, modern science confirms what ancient traditions have always known — Curcumin, the active compound in turmeric, delivers powerful antioxidant and anti-inflammatory benefits. When combined with Boswellin® (Boswellia Serrata), Ginger Root Extract, and BioPerine® for enhanced absorption, it becomes one of the most complete formulas for joint comfort, mobility, and overall vitality.<br><br></p>",
        "left_image": "shopify://shop_images/217272635_1329584270789578_5280560696201114570_n_1.webp",
        "column_title": "Powerful benefits of <span> Turmeric Complex formula</span>",
